---
// TraceCard: a stylized decision trace, pure HTML/CSS on the marketing design tokens.
// Panel 1: a trace (signal, call, reasoning, confidence) with the owner's correction
// pinned as an outcome label. Panel 2: the next occurrence, where theo cites the trace.
// Synthetic data, labeled as such below the card.
---
<div class="tracewrap">
  <div class="trace">
    <div class="t-head">
      <span class="t-kind"><i style="background:var(--amber-d)"></i>Decision trace</span>
      <span class="t-id">#4127 · tue 09:12</span>
    </div>
    <dl class="t-rows">
      <div class="t-row"><dt>Signal</dt><dd>Vendor thread in Slack quiet for 6 days. Task &ldquo;confirm delivery&rdquo; still open.</dd></div>
      <div class="t-row"><dt>Call</dt><dd>Leave the task open <span class="t-tag">conservative-completion</span></dd></div>
      <div class="t-row"><dt>Reasoning</dt><dd>No delivery confirmation found. 2 of 3 similar threads reopened.</dd></div>
      <div class="t-row"><dt>Confidence</dt><dd class="t-conf"><span class="bar"><i style="width:62%"></i></span><span class="pct">0.62</span></dd></div>
    </dl>
    <div class="t-outcome">
      <p class="t-outlabel">Your reply, pinned to this trace</p>
      <p class="t-quote">&ldquo;good catch, that wasn&rsquo;t done&rdquo;</p>
      <div class="t-labels"><span class="t-label ok">confirmed</span><span class="t-label ok">reinforced</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="t-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
  <div class="trace next">
    <div class="t-head">
      <span class="t-kind"><i style="background:var(--accent)"></i>Next occurrence</span>
      <span class="t-id">3 weeks later</span>
    </div>
    <dl class="t-rows">
      <div class="t-row"><dt>Signal</dt><dd>Another vendor thread goes quiet. Same shape.</dd></div>
      <div class="t-row"><dt>Prior</dt><dd><span class="t-cite">cites trace #4127 · confirmed</span></dd></div>
      <div class="t-row"><dt>Call</dt><dd>Keeps the task open, and flags you before assuming it&rsquo;s done.</dd></div>
      <div class="t-row"><dt>Confidence</dt><dd class="t-conf"><span class="bar"><i style="width:88%"></i></span><span class="pct">0.88</span></dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</div>
<p class="t-note">Illustrative trace. Synthetic data.</p>

<style>
  .tracewrap {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: stretch;
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 36px auto 0;
    text-align: left;
    --mono: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  }
  .trace {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px -26px rgba(12, 15, 22, 0.4);
  }
  .trace.next {
    border-color: #d9e5fd;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fbfcff, #fff);
  }
  .t-arrow { align-self: center; color: var(--faint); font-size: 22px; }
  .t-head {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px;
    padding-bottom: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .t-kind {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--faint);
  }
  .t-kind i { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }
  .t-id { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--faint); white-space: nowrap; }
  .t-rows { margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 11px; }
  .t-row dt {
    font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--faint); margin: 0 0 3px;
  }
  .t-row dd { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--body); }
  .t-tag {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--gold);
    background: #fdf6ec; border: 1px solid #eadfc8; border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 2px 9px; margin-left: 6px; white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .t-cite {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--accent-deep);
    background: var(--accent-bg); border: 1px solid #d9e5fd; border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 3px 10px; white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .t-conf { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .bar { flex: 1; height: 6px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--line); overflow: hidden; display: block; }
  .bar i { display: block; height: 100%; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent); }
  .pct { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
  .t-outcome { margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px dashed var(--line); }
  .t-outlabel {
    font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--faint); margin: 0 0 5px;
  }
  .t-quote { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 15.5px; color: var(--ink); margin: 0 0 9px; }
  .t-labels { display: flex; gap: 7px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .t-label {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11.5px; border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px;
  }
  .t-label.ok { color: var(--green); background: #eef9f2; border: 1px solid #cdeeda; }
  .t-note { text-align: center; color: var(--faint); font-size: 12.5px; margin: 12px 0 0; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .tracewrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .t-arrow { transform: rotate(90deg); justify-self: center; }
  }
</style>
